## Fixture: aliased import must not leak bare names (alya-lang/alya#112).
##
## `join` here shadows nothing: the importing file spells it `m::join`.
## Bare `join(...)` calls in the importer must keep resolving to the
## runtime builtin, never to this module.

pub function join(base, relative) -> string
    return "URLJOIN"
end
